Lava-walking sounds like a good plan.

/Cold (and Cone of Cold) solidify lava, giving Kaen a path to you.
Stick to /Fire and /Lightning while you're attacking over lava.  Kaen
is magic resistant, so magic missiles just bounce off.  The spell of
fireball will work, and Kaen doesn't necessarily need to be on a direct
line/diagonal to take damage.  If he's adjacent to a monster that *is*
in your line of fire, he'll be caught in the explosion.

Solidifying the space you're standing on (and burning the E-word there)
should keep any flying/lava-walking nasties at bay.

Logically, invoking the Eye should get you out of there.  I can't
recall trying it (wizmode or otherwise) so don't know for certain.

